		"description": "Complete API documentation for Kidsany Parent Dashboard - A comprehensive system for parents to monitor student progress, attendance, behavior, and communication with teachers.\n\n## Features\n- 60+ REST API endpoints\n- JWT authentication with refresh tokens\n- Role-based access control\n- Real-time notifications\n- Comprehensive filtering and pagination\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:5000/api`\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require JWT authentication. Include the access token in the Authorization header:\n`Authorization: Bearer <your_access_token>`\n\nTokens are also stored in HTTP-only cookies automatically.",
